#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are building this package to use bluetooth devices (rather than as a "
"build dependency), enable the following options in the kernel configuration,"
" also the options in the <quote>Cryptographic API</quote> section if you "
"intend to run the tests, and recompile the kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver construindo esse pacote para usar dispositivos \"bluetooth\""
" (em vez de uma dependência de construção), [então] habilite as seguintes "
"opções na configuração do núcleo, também as opções na seção "
"<quote>Cryptographic API</quote> se você pretende executar os testes e "
"recompile o núcleo, se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "bluez"
msgstr "bluez"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of BlueZ"
msgstr "Instalação do \"BlueZ\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>BlueZ</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>BlueZ</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:146
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var  \\\n"
"            --enable-library      \\\n"
"            --disable-systemd     &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var  \\\n"
"            --enable-library      \\\n"
"            --disable-systemd     &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var  \\\n"
"            --enable-library      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var  \\\n"
"            --enable-library      &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <userinput>make check</userinput>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <userinput>make check</userinput>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svf ../libexec/bluetooth/bluetoothd /usr/sbin</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svf ../libexec/bluetooth/bluetoothd /usr/sbin</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the main configuration file as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o principal arquivo de configuração como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:182
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm555 /etc/bluetooth &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 src/main.conf /etc/bluetooth/main.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm555 /etc/bluetooth &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 src/main.conf /etc/bluetooth/main.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "If desired, install the API documentation as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, instale a documentação da API como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:189
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/bluez-&bluez-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.txt /usr/share/doc/bluez-&bluez-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/bluez-&bluez-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.txt /usr/share/doc/bluez-&bluez-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid "Install a missing D-Bus service as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Instale um serviço ausente do D-Bus como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:196
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -m644 ./obexd/src/org.bluez.obex.service "
"/usr/share/dbus-1/services</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -m644 ./obexd/src/org.bluez.obex.service "
"/usr/share/dbus-1/services</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-library</parameter>: This switch enables building the "
"<application>BlueZ</application> &bluez-major; compatibility library which "
"is required by some applications."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-library</parameter>: Essa chave habilita construir a "
"biblioteca de compatibilidade do <application>BlueZ</application> &bluez-"
"major;, que é exigida por alguns aplicativos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-systemd</parameter>: This switch is needed because "
"<application>systemd</application> is not part of LFS/BLFS. If you are using"
" systemd, remove this switch."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-systemd</parameter>: Essa chave é necessária porque o "
"<application>systemd</application> não é parte do LFS/BLFS. Se você estiver "
"usando o \"systemd\", [então] remova essa chave."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-manpages</option>: This switch disables generating the "
"manual pages. Add this switch if you don't have <xref linkend=\"docutils\"/>"
" installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-manpages</option>: Essa chave desabilita gerar as páginas "
"de manual. Adicione essa chave se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"docutils\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:223
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ln -svf ../libexec/bluetooth/bluetoothd /usr/sbin</command>: This "
"command makes access to the bluetooth daemon more convenient."
msgstr ""
"<command>ln -svf ../libexec/bluetooth/bluetoothd /usr/sbin</command>: Esse "
"comando torna o acesso ao processo de segundo plano \"bluetooth\" mais "
"conveniente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring BlueZ"
msgstr "Configurando o \"BlueZ\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/bluetooth/main.conf</filename> is installed automatically "
"during the install.  Additionally, there are three supplementary "
"configuration files.  /etc/sysconfig/bluetooth is installed as a part of the"
" boot script below.  In addition, you optionally can install the following, "
"as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/bluetooth/main.conf</filename> é instalado automaticamente "
"durante a instalação. Além disso, existem três arquivos de configuração "
"suplementares. \"/etc/sysconfig/bluetooth\" é instalado como parte do script"
" de inicialização abaixo. Além disso, você pode opcionalmente instalar o "
"seguinte, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/bluetooth/main.conf</filename> is installed automatically "
"during the installation. Additionally, there are two supplementary "
"configuration files. You can optionally install the following files as the "
"&root; user:"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/bluetooth/main.conf</filename> é instalado automaticamente "
"durante a instalação. Além disso, existem dois arquivos de configuração "
"suplementares. Você pode opcionalmente instalar os seguintes arquivos como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:249
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat > /etc/bluetooth/rfcomm.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"</userinput>\n"
"<literal># Start rfcomm.conf\n"
"# Set up the RFCOMM configuration of the Bluetooth subsystem in the Linux kernel.\n"
"# Use one line per command\n"
"# See the rfcomm man page for options\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# End of rfcomm.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat > /etc/bluetooth/rfcomm.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"</userinput>\n"
"<literal># Início rfcomm.conf\n"
"# Configura a configuração \"RFCOMM\" do subsistema \"Bluetooth\" no núcleo Linux.\n"
"# Usa uma linha por comando\n"
"# Veja-se a página de manual do \"rfcomm\" para opções\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# Fim do rfcomm.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:259
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat > /etc/bluetooth/uart.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"</userinput>\n"
"<literal># Start uart.conf\n"
"# Attach serial devices via UART HCI to BlueZ stack\n"
"# Use one line per device\n"
"# See the hciattach man page for options\n"
"\n"
"# End of uart.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat > /etc/bluetooth/uart.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"</userinput>\n"
"<literal># Início uart.conf\n"
"# Anexa dispositivos seriais via \"UART HCI\" à pilha \"BlueZ\"\n"
"# Usa uma linha por dispositivo\n"
"# Veja-se a página de manual do \"hciattach\" para opções\n"
"\n"
"# Fim do uart.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:270
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/bluetooth/main.conf"
msgstr "/etc/bluetooth/main.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Bluez Services</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Script de Inicialização</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Serviços Bluez do Systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:280
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start the <command>bluetoothd</command> daemon when the "
"system is rebooted, install the "
"<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/bluetooth</filename> bootscript from the <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar automaticamente o processo de segundo plano "
"<command>bluetoothd</command> quando o sistema for reinicializado, instale o"
" script de inicialização <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/bluetooth</filename> "
"originário do pacote <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:287
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the <command>bluetoothd</command> daemon at boot, enable the "
"previously installed systemd unit by running the following command as the "
"&root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o processo de segundo plano <command>bluetoothd</command> na "
"inicialização, habilite a unidade do systemd instalada anteriormente "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:292
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable bluetooth</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable bluetooth</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:295
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the <command>obexd</command> daemon for a user session (to support "
"some Bluetooth programs using it), enable the previously installed systemd "
"unit for all users by running the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o processo de segundo plano <command>obexd</command> para uma "
"sessão de usuário(a) (para suportar alguns aplicativos \"Bluetooth\" que o "
"utilizam), habilite a unidade do \"systemd\" instalada anteriormente para "
"todos(as) os(as) usuários(as) executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:301
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable --global obex</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable --global obex</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:304
#, xml-text
msgid "bluetooth"
msgstr "bluetooth"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:307
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-bluetooth</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-bluetooth</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/bluez.xml:311
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Systemd</application> will start the Bluetooth daemon only when"
" a bluetooth device is detected on the system."
msgstr ""
"<application>Systemd</application> iniciará o processo de segundo plano "
"\"Bluetooth\" somente quando um dispositivo \"bluetooth\" for detectado no "
"sistema."

